# Turkish 3rd-person possessive suffix -(s)I marks the season in the
# year-first construction ("2020 kışı" == "2020's winter"). "kış" ends in a
# consonant with a back unrounded last vowel (ı), so vowel harmony gives -ı:
# kışı. TDK, İyelik ekleri (possessive suffixes): https://sozluk.gov.tr
kış
kışı
